# Build context hygiene.
#
# The Dockerfile's builder stage runs Maven against the sources, and the final image copies ONLY
# target/classes plus libs/. Nothing here is needed to build, but data/ is 20GB of historical candles
# and runtime state and it was being shipped into the builder on every single build, which is the whole
# reason a rebuild took ten minutes. Measured 2026-09-30: context 21GB, data/ 20GB, docker-buildx at a
# sustained 36% CPU for nine minutes doing nothing but digesting it.
#
# This file does NOT affect the running container: runtime data comes from the compose mounts, not from
# the image.

.git
.gitignore
data
target
**/target
*.log
logs
reports
node_modules
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
